{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":6979,\"title\":\"Smash Lab\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Smash Lab was a reality television series that premiered on December 26, 2007, on the Discovery Channel. The idea of the show is to take everyday technology and test it in \\\"extraordinary ways.\\\"\",\"posterPath\":null,\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/tRO8h2ewbYo/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":3.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":2007,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":20,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Discovery\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"US\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2008-09-18\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1240352,\"name\":\"Deanne Bell\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1231720,\"name\":\"Reverend Gadget\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"tRO8h2ewbYo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"0fnDFa_OhQY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"47GSsX8YdzA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":null,\"seasonAirDate\":\"2008-08-05\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Car Over a Cliff\",\"overview\":\"The team tries to make crashing a car over a cliff survivable. Ideas tested include stabilizing rods, an anchor, and inflatable exterior airbags.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rAZPfVBFMInxvQHotnWDteST19C.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Unbreakable Car\",\"overview\":\"Can a car survive a 55 MPH crash? The team tries various ways to make a car crash-proof, for both side and front impact collisions.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fUMLaDmai1R6m5uGAyrSicgsgZO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Extreme Snow Plow\",\"overview\":\"The Smash Lab team attempts to rescue a pregnant couple stranded in the snow. Ideas tested include a jet-powered snow blower and hot air balloons.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8WCyf8YLXpziguMN9Ly3LsWev3a.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Unsinkable Car\",\"overview\":\"Chuck and Nathaniel try to make a car unsinkable. Deanne and Gadget try to figure out a way to get back on a cruise ship after falling overboard.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6SuhUEKPlhBOdGtV6PX9jrSLdDl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-26\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Runaway Big Rig\",\"overview\":\"The Smash Lab explores various ways to stop a stolen semi truck within a distance of only 100 feet. Deanne and Nathaniel test giant nets, while Chuck and Gadget try to blow the tires by using spikes and explosives.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f9CBMFTGGEDsnI6DaVlVoJcj5Tn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-04\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Trapped in a Boat\",\"overview\":\"The Smash Lab team explores ways to escape from a capsized boat. Chuck and Nathaniel use an air filled bell, while Deanne and Gadget try a plasma cutter.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3qXIiKKBlNhRap7HftnKDl6h3Mo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-11\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Crash-Proof Log Hauler\",\"overview\":\"The Smash Lab team explores various ways to prevent a log hauling truck from crashing off the road.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uOssJPfY2MaNPpst7bi8lG81Xe5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-18\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-12-26\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}